Package: bsa-filestorage
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Stanislav Batyrgareev <sbatyrgareev@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser, @DEPENDS@
Homepage: http://bsasearch.ru/filestorage.html
Description: BSA FileStorage API host - hierarchical file storage service
 HTTP API (ASP.NET Core) and TCP command server over the FileStorage.Core
 hierarchical file storage: files and folders, chunked upload, partial reads,
 change log for synchronization and TTL cleanup.
 Runs as the systemd service bsa-filestorage.
